cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PDDA in scientific work, please cite the RTA paper in
  preferred-citation. For methods beyond core residence-time diffusivity
  estimation, including interval selection and propagator calculation, also
  cite Choosing Spatial Resolution in the Residence-Time Approach to Local
  Diffusivity (arXiv:2610.29703), listed in references. Also cite the stratum
  corneum paper when using its SC reference profiles or propagators, and
  Jonsson's paper when reporting blocking-based uncertainty estimates.
  See README.md for citation guidance.
title: "PDDA: Position-Dependent Diffusivity Analysis"
type: software
version: "0.8"

authors:
  - family-names: von Domaros
    given-names: Michael

